{"id":"00018","root":"uni00018_1","name":{"ja":"クルミ・Ｓ・坂崎","en":"Kurumi S. Sakazaki"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"クルミ・Ｓ・坂崎","en":"Kurumi S. Sakazaki"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":18,"profile":{"ja":"日本人と外人とのハーフ女性。金髪に瞳が黒と青のオッドアイになっていて、一見しただけではどこから見ても外人にしか見えない。本人は日本人を名乗っているが、大抵はだれも信じてくれず最近では自分で訂正することも面倒になり止めている。性格が大雑把で結構ずぼらなために大抵けだるそうにしているが、傭兵としての実力はおりがみつきで、いろいろな企業や組織から契約の話が飛び込んでくる。過去傭兵の時に契約でもらったガントレットと高周波ブレードを使用する。日本人の親の家系が剣術の流れをくんでいて、海外の地でいざという時の身を守るすべとして護身用としてのレベルの剣術を教えられていた。傭兵になってからは剣術に対する知識や技術を本格的に磨いていき、実践で十分通用するレベルまで技術を高めた。基本的には「こっちの方が速い」と刀剣一本で戦場を駆けている。","en":"Kurumi S. Sakazaki is a half-Japanese, half-foreigner woman with blonde hair and heterochromatic eyes—one black, one blue—so strikingly foreign-looking that most people assume she isn't Japanese at all. She claims Japanese heritage, but few believe her, and she's grown tired of constantly correcting them. Her laid-back, somewhat sloppy personality makes her appear perpetually indifferent, yet as a mercenary she's incredibly skilled, attracting contract offers from numerous corporations and organizations. She wields the gauntlet and high-frequency blade she received in a past mercenary contract. Her Japanese parent's family practiced a lineage of swordsmanship, teaching her basic self-defense techniques for use abroad. Since becoming a mercenary, she's honed her knowledge and technique to a level that holds up in real combat, now favoring a single sword and believing \"this side is faster\" as she charges across the battlefield."},"illustrator":"飛燕","voiceActor":"中野志乃","forms":[{"id":"uni00018_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1018,2036],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[130,260],"def":[114,228],"spd":[81,81],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","55"]},{"id":"uni00018_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1536,3072],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[195,390],"def":